  {
   "id": "colossus-down-140641@patch-2025-05-28",
   "gameId": "colossus-down-140641",
   "displayName": "Small patch fixing possible issue with Angelica's fight",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-05-28T08:37:42.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey there!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some time ago, some users reported an issue with one of the boss fights, Angelica's, but we weren't able to reproduce it. We didn't have enough information to look for the possible cause, so we couldn't solve it. But recently, another user (thanks a lot for your help, Ice_Vogel!) who experienced the same issue provided some further information to us and we were able to find and solve the problem.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Probably you never experienced the error, which bugged the honey burst from the flower patches in the third stage of Angelica's fight, which didn't appear, so not being able to win the battle. But in case you experienced it, now is solved.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And that's it. Thanks a lot for your continued support!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
